{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730820/extras/pick2_v2.gif?t=1747244426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Dicewood</u></strong> is a fantasy horror turn-based roguelike deck-builder where adorable forest animals band together to escape the relentless hunter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fleeing into a dark, twisted forest filled with ancient horrors, creepy monsters, and cannibal tribes, player must strategically combine different animals, overcome nightmarish foes, and make their way to the river to start a new life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every roll counts in this high-stakes journey of survival, teamwork, and hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save and collect unique dice-creatures, each with its own abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scary fairytale vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your deck of creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will the animals be safe?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730820/extras/loot_v2.gif?t=1747244426\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730820/extras/combat_rats_V2.gif?t=1747244426\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730820/extras/map_v2.gif?t=1747244426\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730820/extras/combat_complex_v2.gif?t=1747244426\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730820/extras/combat_turtle_v2.gif?t=1747244426\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sh